WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The booking says cleaning is included in €210.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The bill adds a €35 cleaning fee and totals €245.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Cleaning included — but the bill adds €35.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Could you explain why this fee was added?

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Remove €35: the corrected total is €210.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Shuttle included — but the bill adds €18.
